                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p. 769</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d595-f4" n="38" xml:id="d595-f4-content">
                <p>Text of Ethiopian note not found in Department files; for content of the note,
                    see London <hi rendition="#italic">Times</hi>, July 6, 1935, p. 12.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
